\usepackage{chessboard}

\begin{document}
\chessboard[setfen={your_fen_here}]
\end{document}
```

**Steps:**
1. Replace `your_fen_here` with your FEN string (e.g., `8/2k5/8/8/8/8/8/4K3 w - - 0 1` for a king vs. king position).
2. Compile with a LaTeX engine that supports the `chessboard` package (e.g., `pdflatex`).

The `chessboard` package automatically parses the FEN and renders the board. For customization (e.g., flipped boards, notation), see the [package documentation](https://ctan.org/pkg/chessboard).

